'''Jakku's sun'''<ref name="TFA Junior Novel">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: A Junior Novel]]''</ref> was a [[Color|yellow]]-[[Color|white]] [[star]] at the center of the [[Jakku system]]. It was located close enough to [[Jakku]] to create a harsh and hostile environment on the [[planet]].<ref name="TFA" />

